# Advisory ownership and review routing for sensitive operating surfaces.
#
# The six managed rules below are initialized and converged by
# scripts/bootstrap-repository: it substitutes a GitHub-validated owner
# (default: the repository owner when GitHub reports it as a user;
# organization-owned repositories require an explicit --owner USER or
# --owner ORG/TEAM, because a bare organization name cannot own code) and
# verifies the result with --check. The source template legitimately carries
# its current owner here until a generated repository bootstraps. Custom
# rules may be added freely: bootstrap manages only the six managed paths
# below and preserves everything else. This file is required:
# scripts/repo-check enforces its structure; /AGENTS.md maps it as advisory
# ownership and review routing (Protect main does not require code-owner
# approval to merge).
/AGENTS.md @anthracite-labs
/.gitattributes @anthracite-labs
/.agents/ @anthracite-labs
/.github/ @anthracite-labs
/scripts/ @anthracite-labs
/docs/ @anthracite-labs
